OL,3,GNEWSATwo 14-year-olds arrested after
OL,4,Aboy stabbed in park
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo 14-year-old boys have been arrested
OL,7,Fafter another 14-year-old was stabbed
OL,8,Fon a playing field in Peterborough.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Bushfield, in
OL,11,FOrton Goldhay, at about 16:00 BST on
OL,12,FMonday. The victim was taken to
OL,13,FPeterborough City Hospital with serious
OL,14,Finjuries, which police said were not
OL,15,Fbelieved to be life-threatening.
OL,17,FA 14-year-old boy from Peterborough was
OL,18,Farrested on suspicion of grievous
OL,19,Fbodily harm (GBH), possession of a
OL,20,Fknife and theft. He remained in police
OL,21,Fcustody.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
